# tally 2.1.8 item 77 (#201), E §4.1 step 2 and L §4.4: a test of a window-dated movement that comes out one way on
# some of its days and another on the rest is the window's hole, as far as the refusal or the other class would reach.
# jar gives put's leg (into box, alive from 03-08) and pin's (into old, alive to 03-06), both on days of
# window(03-05, 03-10). The plain line was pin's refusal, which three of wo's days don't give: now the hole, and
# windows each gives six lines, one of them 300.00 PLN. A refusal reaching jar after put's uncertain test (pin's,
# with wo on 03-07) doesn't outrank put's hole: which comes first is what wd leaves open. 2.1.7's refcore: refused,
# RUN-LIFESPAN pin.cash. T's d77/lifespan b_jar, rebuilt from the twin check's description.
# tally 2.2 (2.2-4): the clause `windows each` is cut; its asks are the plain line, the hole with each unknown day it
# carries named (`unknown day:`, 2.2-11). A caller who takes the window as one day pins its cell.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind accts: place PLN signed
place jar: accts lives 2025-01-01..
place box: accts lives 2026-03-08..
place old: accts lives 2025-01-01..2026-03-06
input amt: money PLN
input wd: date
input wo: date

move put: transfers
  on wd
  leg cash from jar to box amount amt

move pin: transfers
  on wo
  leg cash from jar to old amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  wd = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-10) "s"
  wo = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-10) "s"
  opening[jar] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[old] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask b_jar: bal(jar, 2026-03-31)
ask b_jar_each: bal(jar, 2026-03-31)
=== expect
b_jar: ?"date within window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-10) not precise enough for a balance" (pin, put)
  unknown day: wd
  unknown day: wo
  cut 2026-01-01
b_jar_each: ?"date within window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-10) not precise enough for a balance" (pin, put)
  unknown day: wd
  unknown day: wo
  cut 2026-01-01
